    LLM: "Focus on taking at least 26 points to avoid the penalty. It is often better to dump high cards into an opponent's trick if you've already reached your threshold.\n\nCount the trumps carefully. Knowing when the 'Jack' and 'Nell' have been played is critical.\n\nTactical passing or leading: Decide whether to push for a match (100+ points) or play conservatively to simply guarantee your single stroke.",
